      "title": "The Internet & E-Commerce Revolution",
      "summary": "The arrival of the web inspired entrepreneurs to rebuild commerce, search, and finance from scratch. Amazon created online retail and cloud infrastructure, while Google organized the world's information. eBay and PayPal proved that digital trust, community feedback, and online money transfer could work globally.",
