      "title": "Deep Tech, Clean Energy & New Frontiers",
      "summary": "Courageous visionaries tackled the hardest physical engineering challenges in transport, space, chips, and AI. Tesla accelerated the transition to electric vehicles and SpaceX achieved reusable orbital spaceflight. ARM created the low-power chip architecture powering modern smartphones, while OpenAI launched generative AI.",
